    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2 data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"5975\">Level 3 — <strong data-start=\"5961\" data-end=\"5975\">Null Field</strong></h2><p data-start=\"5977\" data-end=\"6009\">Your blade suppresses advantage.</p><h3 data-start=\"6011\" data-end=\"6033\">Mechanical Effects</h3><p data-start=\"6034\" data-end=\"6079\">When you hit a creature while at <strong data-start=\"6067\" data-end=\"6078\">Burn 1+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"6080\" data-end=\"6219\"><li data-start=\"6080\" data-end=\"6219\"><p data-start=\"6082\" data-end=\"6143\">Suppress one of the following until the end of its next turn:</p><ul data-start=\"6146\" data-end=\"6219\"><li data-start=\"6146\" data-end=\"6168\"><p data-start=\"6148\" data-end=\"6168\">reroll the lowest die on attacks</p></li><li data-start=\"6171\" data-end=\"6185\"><p data-start=\"6173\" data-end=\"6185\">Bonus damage</p></li><li data-start=\"6188\" data-end=\"6219\"><p data-start=\"6190\" data-end=\"6219\">Morale or inspiration effects</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-start=\"6221\" data-end=\"6236\">At <strong data-start=\"6224\" data-end=\"6235\">Burn 3+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"6237\" data-end=\"6274\"><li data-start=\"6237\" data-end=\"6274\"><p data-start=\"6239\" data-end=\"6274\">The target also loses <strong data-start=\"6261\" data-end=\"6274\">reactions</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"6276\" data-end=\"6303\">Hope falters where you cut.</p>",
